    "2119651080426705372": {
      "account_followers": 20147,
      "account_handle": "DrawingFX_nobuo",
      "account_name": "たけだのぶお",
      "bookmarks": 1,
      "content_en": "To keep trading over the long term, choosing a broker (account) that suits your own trading is also important. For example, if you do a lot of swing or overnight trading and don't care much about spreads, a reassuring broker like XM, with a bonus account plus swap-free, is convenient; conversely, if you're going to scalp like crazy, you get strong benefits from a tight-spread-focused broker like ThreeTrader. Of course you can use multiple brokers for different purposes, and depending on your capital, prop firms become an option too, but regarding this, a jobless old guy said you should research \"how does it suit me?\" rather than what others say.\n\nhttps://t.co/34C7t5ZcbG",
      "content_original": "トレードを長く続けていく上では、自分のトレードに合った業者（口座）選びも大事よな。例えば、スイングや日跨ぎトレードが多くて、スプレッドをあまり気にしないならＸＭみたいなボーナス口座＋スワップフリーもある安心感のある業者が便利だし、逆に、スキャルピングやりまくるぜ！って感じならThreeTraderみたいな狭スプ特化の業者の恩恵が強く得られる。もちろん複数業者を使い分けたり、資金量によってはプロップって選択肢も出てくる訳だけど、これに関しては、人がどうこう言ってるよりも「自分に対してどうか？」ってのをリサーチすべきだって無職のおじさんが言ってた。\n\nhttps://t.co/34C7t5ZcbG",
      "created_at": "2026-11-09T04:39:33Z",
      "enriched_at": "2026-11-09T07:50:03Z",
      "enriched_by": "copilot",
